This independently maintained community plugin derives from Humengjiu's implementation:
https://github.com/Humengjiu/deepseek-harness/pull/1

The 0.2.0 adapter uses the public APIs and released npm packages of
deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness, dsh-v0.2.1-alpha.2.
